# ytarr release / Drive copy

When building a Windows installer (`scripts/build-exe.ps1` or equivalent):

- Always copy the finished installer to `G:\My Drive\exe\` (script default).
- Do **not** pass `-NoCopyToDrive` unless the user explicitly says to skip Drive.
- Do **not** wait for the user to ask to push/copy to Drive — do it as part of every build.
- After a build, report the Drive path (e.g. `G:\My Drive\exe\ytarr-<version>-x64.exe`).
